    "facts": [
      {
        "evidence_id": "S1",
        "en": "The implementation supports the protocol guard for the __call__ method of ServerErrorMiddleware, ensuring that the middleware is only called for HTTP requests. It also tracks the response_started flag to determine when the response has started being sent.",
        "pt-br": "A implementa\u00e7\u00e3o suporta a guarda de protocolo para o m\u00e9todo __call__ do ServerErrorMiddleware, garantindo que o middleware seja chamado apenas para solicita\u00e7\u00f5es HTTP. Al\u00e9m disso, ela rastreia a flag de resposta_started para determinar quando a resposta come\u00e7a a ser enviada."
      }
    ],
